      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this vacant four bedroom semi-detached property to the market which benefits from a SOUTH facing rear garden. Esker Park is a very established, popular enclave with well-proportioned homes and a wealth of amenities close to hand. The Esker Development in Lucan is a highly desirable location offering exceptional convenience. With the M50 and M4 close by, commuting to Dublin and beyond is quick and hassle-free. A wide selection of shops, bars, and restaurants are just minutes away on foot, while several local schools are also within easy walking distance. For added convenience, bus routes are situated right at the front of the development.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 97 sq m comprises of entrance hallway with guest w.c, light filled living room to the front with fully fitted kitchen and seperated dinning room to the rear. Upstairs you will find four good sized bedrooms with the master enuite and the main family bathroom. Externally this property benefits from a SOUTH facing rear garden whilst the front offers a driveway for off street parking.\n\nNo. 107 is presented in good condition throughout and boasts a long list of additional features to include vacant possesion with no onward chain, gas fired central heating, blank canvas perfect for buyers to place their own stamp, double glazed windows, SOUTH facing rear garden and a cul de sac location with a neat green area to the front. Early viewing is highly advised, call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>4 Bed Semi Detatched Family Home</li>\n <li>3 Bathrooms</li>\n <li>Vacant possesion with no onward chain</li>\n <li>Blank canvas for buyers to make as their own</li>\n <li>SOUTH facing rear garden</li>\n <li>Cul de sac location</li>\n <li>Neat green area adjacent the property</li>\n <li>Front driveway for of street parking</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Close to Liffey Valley Shopping Centre</li>\n <li>Viewing highly advised CALL 086 102 5390</li>\n</ul>\nDirections:\n\nEircode = K78YX78"
      },
      {
